  "prefLabel": "Per 102.52 Leave accrual date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.52 “Leave accrual date” means the anniversary date each month on which a full-time employee is eligible to earn annual leave and sick leave for a completed month of service.\n\nSource. #10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.39); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.45), eff 12-1-25",
